name: someblackmagic/rabbitmq-management-ext
# version: 0.1.0
description: Salt extension for managing RabbitMQ through the Management HTTP API

# --- Salt compatibility ---
minimum_version: "3006"
maximum_version: ~

python_requires:
  - ">=3.10"

dependencies:
  - "salt>=3006"

conflicts: []

maintainers:
  - name: SomeBlackMagic
    email: dev@someblackmagic.com
    github: SomeBlackMagic

authors:
  - name: Andrii Chornyi
    email: wiroatom@gmail.com

license: Apache-2.0

website: https://SomeBlackMagic.github.io/salt-rabbitmq-management-ext/
source: https://github.com/SomeBlackMagic/salt-rabbitmq-management-ext
issues: https://github.com/SomeBlackMagic/salt-rabbitmq-management-ext/issues

summary: |
  Provides Salt execution and state modules for managing RabbitMQ resources
  through the RabbitMQ Management HTTP API. No RabbitMQ CLI tools are required
  on the target host.

  Execution modules:
    - rabbitmq_management_mod          — shared Management API HTTP client
    - rabbitmq_management_overview_mod — API connectivity diagnostics
    - rabbitmq_management_vhost_mod    — virtual hosts
    - rabbitmq_management_user_mod     — users and their permissions
    - rabbitmq_management_permission_mod — virtual-host and topic permissions
    - rabbitmq_management_queue_mod    — queues and messages
    - rabbitmq_management_exchange_mod — exchanges and publishing
    - rabbitmq_management_binding_mod  — queue and exchange bindings
    - rabbitmq_management_policy_mod   — policies
    - rabbitmq_management_parameter_mod — runtime parameters
    - rabbitmq_management_federation_mod — federation upstreams
    - rabbitmq_management_shovel_mod   — shovels
    - rabbitmq_management_limit_mod    — user and virtual-host limits

  State modules:
    - rabbitmq_management_vhost_mod      — virtual hosts and virtual-host limits
    - rabbitmq_management_user_mod       — users and user limits
    - rabbitmq_management_permission_mod — virtual-host permissions
    - rabbitmq_management_queue_mod      — queues
    - rabbitmq_management_exchange_mod   — exchanges
    - rabbitmq_management_binding_mod    — queue and exchange bindings
    - rabbitmq_management_policy_mod     — policies
    - rabbitmq_management_parameter_mod  — runtime parameters
    - rabbitmq_management_federation_mod — federation upstreams
    - rabbitmq_management_shovel_mod     — shovels
